			<div class="content" id="post-content-2666023">
									

<p>You'll notice a theme in a lot of things I write. Truth is, a lot of my family are from southern Indiana, and a lot of my family had business in and around mines. When you work in a business like that, you hear plenty of stories, and when you hear those stories as a kid, they stick with you. Become larger than life, even.</p>
